  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.bpmmismatch">Tempo proyek DAW tidak sama dengan tempo proyek.Tiimeline keduanya hanya akan sama di detik, bukan di bar-nya — samakan tempo agar saling sinkron.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.caption">Integrasi DAW</system:String>
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.col.apiversion">API</system:String>-->
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.col.compatibility">Status</system:String>-->
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.col.name">Plugin</system:String>-->
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.col.port">Port</system:String>-->
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.col.state">Koneksi</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.compatible">Kompatibel</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.connect">Hubungkan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.connected">Terhubung ke {0}.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.connected.count">Terhubung ke {0} plugin.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.connecting">Menghubungkan...</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.disconnect">Putuskan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.disconnected">Tidak terhubung.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caps.1">Mengedit real-time — project dan bagian terrender langsung muncul di DAW begitu kamu mengeditnya.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caps.2">Satu instance plugin setiap trek DAW; pilih trek OpenUtau mana yang diputar setiap instance dari window plugin atau panel automasi DAW.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caps.3">Sinkronkan playhead — playhead OpenUtau mengikuti playhead DAW.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caps.4">Ramah ekspor — lompatan DAW menunggu bagian selesai dirender, jadi ekspornya mengikuti pemutaran.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caps.header">Bisa apa saja</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.caption">Cara menggunakan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.download">Download {0}</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.clap">Instal CLAP</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.clap.reinstall">Instal ulang CLAP</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.done">Terinstal ke {0}. Pindai ulang plugin di DAW Anda, lalu klik Refresh.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.downloading">Mendownload... {0}%</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.elevfail">Penyalinan gagal ({0}), jadi plugin diinstal ke folder per-user {1}. Pindai ulang plugin di DAW kamu, lalu klik Refresh.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.extracting">Mengekstrak...</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.failed">Instalasi gagal: {0}</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.fallback">Izin administrator ditolak, jadi plugin akan diinstal di folder per-user {1}. Pindai ulang plugin di DAW Anda, lalu klik Refresh.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.header">Instal plugin (terdeteksi di perangkat ini)</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.preparing">Menyiapkan download...</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.vst3">Instal VST3</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.install.vst3.reinstall">Instal ulang VST3</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.installed.no">Belum instal</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.installed.ok">Terinstal</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.manual">Panduan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.manual.zh">Panduan (Tionghoa)</system:String>
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.paths.linux">VST3: ~/.vst3
CLAP: ~/.clap</system:String>-->
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.paths.mac">VST3: ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3
CLAP: ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/CLAP</system:String>-->
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.paths.win">VST3: C:\Program Files\Common Files\VST3
CLAP: C:\Program Files\Common Files\CLAP
Tak punya hak admin? Gunakan %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Common\VST3 (or ...\CLAP) instead.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.releases">Semua rilisan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.scope.1">Bridge hanya bekerja di satu komputer, dan DAW kamu harus sudah memuat instrumen VST3 atau CLAP (REAPER, Cubase, FL Studio, Studio One, Ableton Live, Bitwig, ...).</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.scope.2">Dua timeline dalam satu waktu — kedua project berjalan dengan BPM sama agar bar tetap selaras.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.scope.3">OpenUtau hanya membawa vokal: volume, pan, mute, dan efek dapat kamu atur sendiri di mixer DAW</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.scope.header">Batasan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.step1">1. Instal pluginL klik tombol instal di atas (beri izin administrator bila muncul), atau download manual dan salin seisi folder "OpenUtau Bridge.vst3" ke plugin DAW kamu:</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.step2">2. Di DAW kamu, tambahkan trek instrumen dan masukkan "OpenUtau Bridge" (vendor OpenUTAU). Lakukan saat OpenUtau belum dibuka — jadi DAW dibuka dulu.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.step3">3. Buka OpenUtau, simpan project kamu, lalu balik ke DAW: Refresh, pilih plugin, Connect.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.steps.header">Penyiapan (tiga tahap)</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.guide.what">OpenUtau Bridge adalah plugin gratis (VST3/CLAP) untuk DAW kamu. Fungsinya untuk menerima proyek/hasil render audio dan meletakkannya di timeline DAW: berkreasi di OpenUtau, dan mix audionya di DAW. Itu tak dapat berfungsi mandiri dan tak perlu banyak penyiapan di OpenUtau.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.hint">Hubungkan ke plugin DAW listener di perangkat ini. Pengeditan dilakukan di OpenUtau; plugin hanya menerima hasil render audio proyek.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.incompatible">Versi API tak didukung.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.lost">Koneksi hilang: {0}</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.none">Tak ada plugin DAW ditemukan. Muat plugin OpenUtau Bridge di track instrument DAW Anda, lalu refresh. Baru coba? Silahkan periksa "Cara menggunakan" di atas. </system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.none.installed">Plugin bridge terinstal, tapi tak ada instance ditemukan. Muat OpenUtau Bridge di track instrument DAW Anda, lalu klik Refresh.</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.reconnecting">Menghubungkan ulang ke{0}...</system:String>
  <!--<system:String x:Key="dawintegration.refresh">Refresh</system:String>-->
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.state.connected">Terhubung</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.state.connecting">Menghubungkan</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.state.free">Tak terhubung</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.state.reconnecting">Menghubungkan ulang</system:String>
  <system:String x:Key="dawintegration.unsavedproject">Proyek belum disimpan. Simpan dulu, baru hubungkan plugin DAW — proyek yang belum disimpan tidak akan muncul di DAW.</system:String>

